      "content": "interesting. you're saying it's more about the division than the actual goals they claim to have. going along with that, if we're looking at the economic side, is it fair to say their whole plan for redistribution is basically just a way to penalize success and punish productivity? how would you word that to make it sound like an undeniable reality rather than just an opinion?",
